# probe (quest rework P8): currency <name> <n>, a GM's player:addCurrency(name, n). Dances with Luopans (adoulin 118,
# still Lua): Sylvie (Western Adoulin) sells the Matre Bell after the quest: 37, whose update on option 2 checks
# player:getCurrency('bayld') >= 150000 (param 1, payment 2), and whose finish on option 1 then gives the bell and takes
# the bayld (delCurrency). Completed (a GM), a level 99 Geomancer with little gil: 150000 bayld by the step, then 37,
# update 2: param 1; finished on 1: the bell, the bayld taken.
lists WesternAdoulin/Sylvie/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/onEventUpdate/37 WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/37
char zone=WesternAdoulin pos=79.594,32,135.725 job=GEO lvl=99 gil=100
quest Adoulin.DancesWithLuopans completed
login
currency bayld 150000                   # a GM: 150000 bayld
trigger Sylvie                          # completed, a Geomancer, no bell: 37
update 37 option=2                      # 150000 bayld: param 1, payment 2
finish option=1                         # the Matre Bell; 150000 bayld taken
